  Ethical hacker also known as white hacker are security experts, organizations hire to find 
weaknesses in their system before maliciuos hackers can exploit them these ethical hackers run 
tests to see if they can break into the bank internal environment in a controled legal way. If 
they find any gap or weaknesses in securitythey report them to the management, which can then 
fix those issues beforre an actual attack happens

defend cyber threat and identify vulnerabilities. ethical hacker discover weak password, outdated 
software and other vulnberability that would otherwise expose the organization to risk 

penetration testing : penetration testing is a structure approach to ethical hacking. its a 
planned, authorized attempt to evaluate a system's security by exploiting vulnerabilities, just
like a real attacker might penetration testing helps an organization discover vulnerabilities and 
flows in thier system that they might not have otherwise been able to find. it is a must for 
