Question 3c
 Explain how ISC² or ISACA frameworks can support the organization’s compliance and network redesign 
(e.g., CIS controls, COBIT, security governance).  


                                       Answer to 3c
  ISACA (Information Systems Audit and Control Association) helps organizations strengthen their 
digital trust, security, and governance by providing industry-leading frameworks, professional 
certifications, and best practices in audit, risk management and cybersecurity
  COBIT (Control Objectives for Information and Related Technologies) is a widely usedframework
developed by ISACA to manage and govern enterprise IT, ensuring technology aligns with business
goals, optimizes risks, and creates value. It is primarily used to bridge the gap between technical
issues, business risks, and control requirements.


